Frontend

Framework: Next.js with React
Language: TypeScript
Styling:

Tailwind CSS
shadcn/ui component library


Features:

Interactive dashboards
Document management interface



Backend

API Server: Flask
Cross-Origin Support: Flask-Cors
Environment Management: python-dotenv
Utility Libraries:

requests (HTTP client)
pytz (timezone handling)



Database & Authentication

Database: PostgreSQL (managed through Supabase)
Data Access Layer: Supabase Python library
Authentication: Supabase Auth

AI Integration

AI Framework: OpenAI
Token Management: tiktoken
Features: AI-powered document generation

Application Features

User management and authentication
Conference management system
Document management and generation
User statistics and analytics
Responsive design with theme support

Architecture
This is a full-stack application with a clear separation between:

Next.js frontend (React/TypeScript)
Flask backend API
Supabase for database and authentication services